.TH BITCOINCASHD(1) Version 1.3.0 | User Commands

.SH NAME
litecoincashd - Litecoin Cash daemon

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B litecoincashd
[\fIOPTION\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION
Litecoin Cash daemon, the full node implementation for Litecoin Cash.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB-conf=<file>\fR
Configuration file (default: ~/.litecoincash/litecoincash.conf)

.SH BUGS
Report bugs to https://github.com/Litecoin Cash/Litecoin Cash/issues

